<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink184-kilavi">
       āyamakaḷiruḷ niṉṉāl nayakkappaṭṭāḷ yāvaḷ eṉa viṉaviya tōḻikkut talaimakaṉ colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        Spoken by the hero to the confidante who asked [him] 'Which one is she among the group of girls, the one who is desired by you?'</p>
  </div>   
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink185">
<l>alaṅkitaḻ neytaṟ koṟkai muṉṟuṟai</l>
<l>yilaṅkumut tuṟaikku meyiṟukeḻu tuvarvā</l>
<l>yarampō ḻavvaḷaik kuṟumaka</l>
<l>ṇarampārt taṉṉa tīṅkiḷa viyaḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The petite woman with cross-filed, pretty, conch-bangles, </l>
        <l>[And] a coral mouth that have teeth from which shining pearls spill over,</l>
        <l>[In] the front-ghat of Koṟkai with Neytal flowers with swaying petals drip,</l>
        <l>Is one of sweet words that resemble the sound of the musical strings.</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
